BT /F2 17 Tf 54.00 779.89 Td (Sales Return - Procedure \(SOP\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 761.39 Td (Purpose: How to record a customer sales return \(credit note\) in the ERP, what the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 746.89 Td (system posts to the accounts, and how to verify it afterwards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 728.39 Td (Who does this: Accounts / Sales back-office.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 709.89 Td (Module: Sales > Sales Returns \(screen title: "Sales Returns / Credit Notes"\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 681.39 Td (1. Before you start \(prerequisites\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 666.89 Td (  - 1. The goods must have been DISPATCHED to the customer earlier - a sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 652.39 Td (    return is always recorded against an existing Dispatch. If there is no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 637.89 Td (    dispatch, there is nothing to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 623.39 Td (  - 2. For the COST reversal to post automatically, the product should have a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 608.89 Td (    Standard Cost set in the product master. If not, the sale value is still) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 594.39 Td (    reversed but the cost-of-goods part is skipped \(posts Rs. 0\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 579.89 Td (  - 3. The customer must roll up to a Billing Customer \(the accounting customer\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 565.39 Td (    If a ship-to customer has no billing customer set, the accounting entry is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 550.89 Td (    skipped - fix the customer record first.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 522.39 Td (2. Step-by-step: record a sales return) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 507.89 Td (  - 1. Go to Sales > Sales Returns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 493.39 Td (  - 2. Click New Return \(top-right\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 478.89 Td (  - 3. Select the original Dispatch the goods are coming back from. The screen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 464.39 Td (    loads that dispatch's products, the dispatched quantity, and the unit price) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 449.89 Td (    from the original order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 435.39 Td (  - 4. Enter header details: Return Date \(defaults to today\); Reason \(Damaged /) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 420.89 Td (    Quality issue / Wrong item / Excess delivery / Customer cancelled / Other\);) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 406.39 Td (    Notes \(optional\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 391.89 Td (  - 5. For each product line, enter the Return Quantity \(in dozens\). You cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 377.39 Td (    return more than was dispatched. Decimals are allowed \(e.g. 0.5\). A per-line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 362.89 Td (    reason is optional.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 348.39 Td (  - 6. Check the auto-calculated totals: Subtotal = Return Qty x Unit Price; COGS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 333.89 Td (    Total = Return Qty x Product Standard Cost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 319.39 Td (  - 7. Click Save & Post. The return is numbered automatically as SRN-YYYYMM-NNNN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 304.89 Td (    \(e.g. SRN-202606-0007\). If auto-posting is enabled, the accounting voucher is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 290.39 Td (    created immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 261.89 Td (3. What the system posts to the accounts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 243.39 Td (A sales return creates ONE balanced Journal Voucher with up to two parts:) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54.00 224.89 Td (A\) Sales / Receivable reversal \(always\):) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54.00 206.39 Td (Account                            | Debit              | Credit            ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 191.89 Td (-----------------------------------+--------------------+-------------------) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 177.39 Td (Sales Returns \(4010\)               | Return sales value |                   ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 162.89 Td (Accounts Receivable - the customer |                    | Return sales value) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 144.39 Td (This reduces the customer's outstanding balance and reduces net sales.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54.00 125.89 Td (B\) Cost / Inventory reversal \(only if a Standard Cost exists\):) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54.00 107.39 Td (Account                   | Debit             | Credit           ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 92.89 Td (--------------------------+-------------------+------------------) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 78.39 Td (Finished Goods Inventory  | Return cost value |                  ) Tj ET
endstream
