BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 785.89 Td (Cost of Goods Sold \(5100\) |                   | Return cost value) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 767.39 Td (This puts the cost of the returned goods back into inventory value and reduces) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 752.89 Td (COGS. The voucher narration records the customer, the return reference, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 738.39 Td (reason.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 709.89 Td (4. Important notes / limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 695.39 Td (  - PHYSICAL STOCK IS NOT AUTOMATICALLY INCREASED. The return posts the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 680.89 Td (    accounting entries \(value back into Finished Goods\) but does not change the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 666.39 Td (    physical stock count. If you track physical quantities, record the stock) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 651.89 Td (    receipt of the returned goods separately in the inventory module.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 637.39 Td (  - No cost entry without a standard cost. If the product has no Standard Cost,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 622.89 Td (    only the sales/receivable side \(Part A\) posts; the cost side \(Part B\) is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 608.39 Td (    skipped.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 593.89 Td (  - Accounting auto-post can be off. If automatic posting is turned off, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 579.39 Td (    return is saved but not posted. In that case post it from the accounting side) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 564.89 Td (    \(Section 6\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 536.39 Td (5. How to verify the return afterwards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 521.89 Td (  - Customer balance: Accounting > Party Ledger > select the customer. The return) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 507.39 Td (    voucher appears and reduces their outstanding balance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 492.89 Td (  - Sales Returns account: Accounting > General Ledger > select Sales Returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 478.39 Td (    \(4010\) to see the debit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 463.89 Td (  - Profit & Loss: the period's net revenue drops by the returned sales value) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 449.39 Td (    \(and COGS by the returned cost\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 434.89 Td (  - The return is listed on Sales > Sales Returns with its SRN- number and status) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 420.39 Td (    Posted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 391.89 Td (6. Alternative: direct entry from the Accounting module) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 373.39 Td (If there is no specific dispatch to tie to \(e.g. a one-off adjustment\), use the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 358.89 Td (simpler ledger-only screen at Accounting > Sales Return:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 344.39 Td (  - 1. Select the Customer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 329.89 Td (  - 2. Enter the Return Date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 315.39 Td (  - 3. Enter the Sales Amount \(revenue to reverse\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 300.89 Td (  - 4. Enter the COGS Amount \(cost to reverse\) - optional; leave 0 if not known.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 286.39 Td (  - 5. Add a Reference and Notes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 271.89 Td (  - 6. Click Post Sales Return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 253.39 Td (This posts the same entries as Section 3 but without dispatch/product-line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 238.89 Td (detail. Prefer Sales > Sales Returns whenever a dispatch exists.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 54.00 210.39 Td (7. Quick reference) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54.00 191.89 Td (Item            | Value                                                    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 177.39 Td (----------------+----------------------------------------------------------) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 162.89 Td (Screen          | Sales > Sales Returns                                    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 148.39 Td (Document number | SRN-YYYYMM-NNNN \(auto\)                                   ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 133.89 Td (Quantity unit   | Dozens \(decimals allowed\)                                ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 119.39 Td (Sales reversal  | Dr Sales Returns 4010 / Cr Accounts Receivable \(customer\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 104.89 Td (Cost reversal   | Dr Finished Goods / Cr COGS 5100 \(only if standard cost\) ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 90.39 Td (Physical stock  | Not updated automatically                                ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 75.89 Td (Statuses        | Draft > Posted > Cancelled                               ) Tj ET
